Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='ordercausal', at=datetime(2026, 9, 4, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='Order is causal, time is data', body="*ORDER IS CAUSAL, TIME IS DATA* (2026-09-04). What a write supersedes is ancestry alone; `at` is stamped by the writer on receipt and used only as data (deadlines, completions, the time machine's window). No clock decides who wins. Events on different todos commute (law); concurrent writes to one register are a conflict to show and settle, never a tiebreak.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-04.', supersedes=()))